      "op": "compile",
      "handle": "c",
      "source": {
        "profile": "band-contract/file-source/1",
        "format": "frontmatter",
        "content": "---\nname: selected-deadlines\ndescription: Test selected deadlines with explicit roles and outcomes.\nengine: 0.2.0-lab.1\nroles: [lead, alpha, beta]\n---\n\"\"\"\nThe lead starts work with two members, who each acknowledge on their own deadline: Alpha within\ntwo minutes, Beta within five. The lead then finishes it.\n\"\"\"\ncontract @4h mentions 2 => expired\n\n\"\"\"\nYou are the lead. Start the work, wait for both acknowledgements, then send finish.\n\"\"\"\nrole lead\n\n\"\"\"\nYou are Alpha. Acknowledge the start within two minutes.\n\"\"\"\nrole alpha\n\n\"\"\"\nYou are Beta. Acknowledge the start within five minutes.\n\"\"\"\nrole beta\n\n\"\"\"\nStart the work with both members.\n\"\"\"\ntype start\n\n\"\"\"\nConfirm that you received the start. The message carries no content.\n\"\"\"\ntype ack\n\n\"\"\"\nFinish the work. Nothing follows.\n\"\"\"\ntype finish\n\n\"\"\"\nThe lead has not started yet. Send start to Alpha and Beta.\n\"\"\"\nstate new\n  lead -> {alpha,beta}: start() => waiting\n\n\"\"\"\nAlpha owes an acknowledgement within two minutes and Beta within five. The lead finishes when\nready.\n\"\"\"\nstate waiting\n  event alpha -> lead: ack() @2m => alpha_late\n  event beta -> lead: ack() @5m => beta_late\n  lead -> {alpha,beta}: finish() => complete\n\n\"\"\"\nThe lead finished the work. Send nothing more.\n\"\"\"\nend complete\n\n\"\"\"\nAlpha did not acknowledge within two minutes. Stop, and tell the lead Alpha is missing.\n\"\"\"\nend alpha_late\n\n\"\"\"\nBeta did not acknowledge within five minutes. Stop, and tell the lead Beta is missing.\n\"\"\"\nend beta_late\n\n\"\"\"\nThe four-hour contract clock ran out. Send nothing more.\n\"\"\"\nend expired\n",
        "sha256": "eabccbf7bf6cce6a744b2dc4d86544d94b58f97b1ea84cd545c5cb80eb525ed1"
      }
    },
    {
